<html lang="en">

<head>
  <title>Design Log Methodology | Jay Framework</title>
  <meta name="description"
    content="The Design Log methodology — a rigorous, document-first approach to software architecture that keeps AI agents and human developers aligned.">
  <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" src="../../components/site-header/site-header"
    contract="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-contract"
    template="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-html"></script>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml"
    href="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles/theme.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <style>
    /* ── Shared ── */
    .section {
      padding: 96px 0;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 16px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .text-muted {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }

    .text-primary {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .text-center {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .glass-panel {
      background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .glass-panel:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
    }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .dl-hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 96px 0;
      /* design-system: allow */
      padding-top: 160px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .dl-hero-grid {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      opacity: 0.3;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .dl-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .dl-hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    @keyframes shimmer-pass {
      0% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      15% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      35% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }

      100% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }
    }

    .dl-hero-headline {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .shimmer-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .dl-hero-headline .shimmer-base {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .dl-hero-headline .shimmer-shine {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 46%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 54%, transparent 65%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      animation: shimmer-pass 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .dl-hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 32px auto 0;
    }

    .dl-hero-methodology-link {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .dl-hero-methodology-link a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .dl-hero-methodology-link a:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .dl-browse-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      /* design-system: allow */
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .dl-hero-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .dl-hero-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.15);
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }

    .dl-hero-link:hover {
      border-color: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.35);
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .dl-hero-link img {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    /* ── Intro Section ── */
    .intro-section {
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }

    .intro-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .intro-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    .intro-cards {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .intro-text h2 {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .intro-text p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .intro-text p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .intro-highlight-box {
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    }

    .intro-highlight-box h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .intro-highlight-box p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
    }

    /* ── Transparency Section ── */
    .transparency-section {
      background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
    }

    .transparency-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .transparency-content h2 {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .transparency-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .transparency-content p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .site-footer {
      background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      padding: 48px 0;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-gutter);
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 2fr;
      }
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .footer-copyright {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 16px;
    }

    .footer-heading {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      transition: color 0.3s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-secondary-dim);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @scope (.siteHeader) {

      /* ── Header ── */
      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(14, 19, 34, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px var(--margin-mobile);
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-inner {
          padding: 16px var(--margin-desktop);
        }
      }

      @keyframes brand-shimmer {
        0% {
          background-position: -200% center;
        }

        100% {
          background-position: 400% center;
        }
      }

      .header-brand {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .brand-text-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .header-brand .brand-base {
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .header-brand .brand-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 45%, rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.9) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 55%, transparent 60%);
        background-size: 300% auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: brand-shimmer 5s linear infinite;
      }

      .header-nav {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 32px;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-nav {
          display: flex;
        }
      }

      .header-nav a {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .header-nav a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .header-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .btn-get-started {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 8px 24px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .btn-get-started:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* Hide Get Started + GitHub on mobile, show hamburger */
      .header-actions .btn-get-started {
        display: none;
      }

      .header-actions .header-github {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      /* Hamburger button */
      .hamburger-toggle {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 0;
      }

      .hamburger-icon {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        width: 18px;
      }

      .hamburger-icon span {
        display: block;
        height: 2px;
        background: currentColor;
        border-radius: 1px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        transition: transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
      }

      /* Mobile menu */
      #mobile-menu-toggle {
        display: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        z-index: 49;
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest, #0a0f1e);
        padding: 80px var(--margin-mobile) 32px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(3) {
        transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.mobile-menu {
        display: flex;
      }

      .mobile-menu a {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .mobile-menu a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github svg {
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-actions .btn-get-started {
          display: inline-flex;
        }

        .header-actions .header-github {
          display: flex;
        }

        .hamburger-toggle {
          display: none;
        }

        .mobile-menu {
          display: none !important;
        }
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page-root"><jay:site-header ref="siteHeader">
      <div class="site-header-root"><input type="checkbox" id="mobile-menu-toggle">
        <header class="site-header">
          <nav class="header-inner"><a href="/" class="header-brand" aria-label="Jay Framework"><img
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg"
                alt="" class="brand-icon" width="32" height="32" loading="eager"><span
                class="brand-text-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="brand-base">Jay
                  Framework</span><span class="brand-shine" aria-hidden="true">Jay
                  Framework</span></span></a>
            <div class="header-nav" override="children"><a href="/aiditor-intro">AIditor</a><a
                href="/ecosystem">Ecosystem</a><a href="/docs">Documentation</a><span>Design Log</span></div>
            <div class="header-actions"><a class="header-github"
                href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"
                aria-label="GitHub"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <g fill="currentColor">
                    <path
                      d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                    </path>
                  </g>
                </svg></a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started">Get Started</a><label
                for="mobile-menu-toggle" class="hamburger-toggle" aria-label="Menu">
                <div class="hamburger-icon"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </label></div>
          </nav>
        </header>
        <div class="mobile-menu" override="children"><a href="/aiditor-intro"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">AIditor</a><a
            href="/ecosystem"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Ecosystem</a><a
            href="/docs"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Documentation</a><span>Design Log</span>
          <div class="mobile-menu-actions"><a class="mobile-menu-github"
              href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"><svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="currentColor">
                  <path
                    d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                  </path>
                </g>
              </svg> GitHub</a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started"
              onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false"
              style="text-align: center; justify-content: center;">Get Started</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </jay:site-header>
    <main>
      <section class="dl-hero">
        <div class="dl-hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="dl-hero-content"><span class="dl-hero-badge">METHODOLOGY</span>
            <h1 class="dl-hero-headline"><span class="shimmer-wrap"><span
                  class="shimmer-base">Design Log Methodology</span><span class="shimmer-shine"
                  aria-hidden="true">Design Log Methodology</span></span></h1>
            <p class="dl-hero-subtitle">Jay is built using the Design Log methodology — a rigorous,
              document-first approach to software architecture. Every significant feature is
              designed in writing before a single line of code is written.</p>
            <h2 class="dl-browse-title">Browse Design Logs</h2>
            <div class="dl-hero-links"><a class="dl-hero-link" href="/design-log/jay/index"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">Jay
                Framework</a><a class="dl-hero-link" href="/design-log/wix/readme"><svg
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path>
                  <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path>
                  <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
                </svg>Wix Integration</a><a class="dl-hero-link"
                href="/design-log/website/index"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20"
                  height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                  <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
                  <path
                    d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z">
                  </path>
                </svg>Website</a></div>
            <div class="dl-hero-methodology-link"><a
                href="https://github.com/yoavaa/design-log-methodology" target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14"
                  height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
                  style="vertical-align: -2px; margin-right: 4px;">
                  <path
                    d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                  </path>
                </svg> Design Log Methodology on GitHub &rarr;</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section intro-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="intro-layout">
            <div class="intro-text"><span class="section-label">Overview</span>
              <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">What is a Design Log?</h2>
              <p>A Design Log is a structured document that captures the full decision-making
                process for a feature or architectural change. It's not a spec, not a ticket, and
                not documentation — it's a living record of <strong
                  style="color: var(--color-text);">why</strong> things are built the way they are.
              </p>
              <p>Unlike traditional design documents that become stale, design logs are
                written<strong style="color: var(--color-text);">before implementation
                  begins</strong> and serve as the single source of truth throughout the development
                process. They capture the context, constraints, trade-offs, and decisions that code
                alone cannot convey.</p>
              <p>The methodology was born out of the need to give AI agents — and human developers —
                a reliable reference point. When multiple agents collaborate on a complex system,
                ambiguity is the enemy. The design log eliminates ambiguity by making intent
                explicit and verifiable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="intro-cards">
              <div class="intro-highlight-box glass-panel">
                <h3>The Design Log is the Source of Truth</h3>
                <p>Any plan — whether provided by the user, generated during plan mode, or inferred
                  by an AI agent — must be validated against the design log before implementation.
                  If a plan deviates from the design log, the deviation must be flagged. The design
                  log takes precedence over guesses, assumptions, or blind code searches.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="intro-highlight-box glass-panel">
                <h3>Required for Every Contribution</h3>
                <p>Every contribution to Jay — whether from a human developer or an AI agent — must
                  follow the Design Log methodology. New features and architectural changes require
                  a design log to be written and approved before implementation begins. No code is
                  merged without it.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section transparency-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="transparency-content"><span class="section-label">Transparency</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Open Design, Not Just Open Source</h2>
            <p>We believe open source frameworks should be transparent beyond the code. That means
              publishing not just what we built, but how we designed it — what we tried, what
              failed, and how the system evolved over time.</p>
            <p>Jay's design logs are a public record of every architectural decision, dead end, and
              trade-off. They show the reasoning behind the code, not just the result. If you want
              to understand why Jay works the way it does, the answer is always in the design log.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
